Description: context-aware hint overlay for wlroots Wayland compositors
 wayhint shows a small overlay of the shortcuts, commands and notes you wrote
 for the app in front of you, and switches them as the focused window or the
 command running in a terminal changes. It runs on labwc and Wayfire through
 layer-shell and wlr-foreign-toplevel-management, never takes keyboard focus
 while shown, and lets you search, add and edit hints inside the overlay.
 .
 Hints are plain YAML files under ~/.config/wayhint/. Nothing in them is ever
 executed. wayhintd is started from the compositor's autostart; no systemd
 unit is shipped.
